          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Expressions Using Letter-Numbers"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.088,
            0.847,
            0.125
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "As it is the sequence of multiples of 4, it can be seen that the nth term will be 4 times n:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.471,
            0.132,
            0.527,
            0.148
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_2.jpg",
          "content": "4 \\times n"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.155,
            0.846,
            0.21
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "As a standard practice, we shorten "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 \\; \\times \\; n"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " to 4n by skipping the multiplication sign. We write the number first, followed by the letter(s). Find the value of the expression 7k when "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "k = 4"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . The value is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "7 \\times 4 = 2 8"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.21,
            0.766,
            0.229
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Find the value that the expression 5m + 3 takes when "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "m = 2 ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.229,
            0.82,
            0.265
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "As 5m stands for "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\times m"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , the value of the expression when "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "m = 2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\times 2 + 3 = 13"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.284,
            0.6,
            0.306
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mind the Mistake, Mend the Mistake"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.316,
            0.848,
            0.355
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Some simplifications are shown below where the letter-numbers are replaced by numbers and the value of the expression is obtained."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.358,
            0.738,
            0.378
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Observe each of them and identify if there is a mistake."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.383,
            0.848,
            0.421
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. If you think there is a mistake, try to explain what might have gone wrong."
            }
          ]
        },
